ING NOTHING COULD EQUAL MY DELIGHT ON SEEING CLERVAL HIS PRESENCE BROUGHT BACK TO MY THOUGHTS MY FATHER ELIZABETH AND ALL THOSE SCENES OF HOME SO DEAR TO MY RECOLLECTION
