YOUR DISASTER IS IRREPARABLE
WE ACCORDINGLY LAY TO HOPING THAT SOME CHANGE WOULD TAKE PLACE IN THE ATMOSPHERE AND WEATHER
HOW KIND AND GENEROUS YOU ARE
