AND OF CLERVAL ALL LEFT BEHIND ON WHOM THE MONSTER MIGHT SATISFY HIS SANGUINARY AND MERCILESS PASSIONS
NOTHING COULD EXCEED IN BEAUTY THE CONTRAST BETWEEN THESE TWO EXCELLENT CREATURES
